request.description:
Service health check endpoint.

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "status": "ok"
  }
}
```

Register a new user account.

Example Response (201 Created):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
      "name": "Jane Doe",
      "email": "jane@example.com",
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsIn..."
  }
}
```

Authenticate user and set collection token variable.

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
      "name": "Jane Doe",
      "email": "jane@example.com",
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsIn..."
  }
}
```

Retrieve profile of authenticated caller.

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
      "name": "Jane Doe",
      "email": "jane@example.com",
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
```

Retrieve all registered users with pagination (Admin only).

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "users": [
      {
        "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
        "name": "Jane Doe",
        "email": "jane@example.com",
        "role": "admin",
        "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10,
      "total": 1,
      "totalPages": 1
    }
  }
}
```

Create a project workspace. The creator is set as owner and member.

Example Response (201 Created):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "project": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012b",
      "title": "Backend Infrastructure",
      "description": "API redesign and security hardening",
      "owner": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
      "members": ["660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a"],
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:05:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
```

Get all projects where caller is owner or member.

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "projects": [
      {
        "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012b",
        "title": "Backend Infrastructure",
        "description": "API redesign and security hardening",
        "owner": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
        "members": ["660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a"],
        "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:05:00.000Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Retrieve project details with populated owner and members. Non-members receive 404 to avoid leaking existence.

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "project": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012b",
      "title": "Backend Infrastructure",
      "description": "API redesign and security hardening",
      "owner": { "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a", "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.com" },
      "members": [{ "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a", "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.com" }],
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:05:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
```

Update project title or description (Owner only).

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "project": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012b",
      "title": "Updated Infrastructure Title",
      "description": "Updated scope and description",
      "owner": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
      "members": ["660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a"],
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:05:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
```

Add a collaborator by email or userId (Owner only).

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "project": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012b",
      "title": "Backend Infrastructure",
      "members": [
        { "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a", "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.com" },
        { "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012c", "name": "Colleague", "email": "colleague@example.com" }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Create a task under the specified project (Project members only).

Example Response (201 Created):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "task": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012d",
      "title": "Implement JWT Rotation",
      "description": "Add refresh tokens and rotation logic",
      "status": "todo",
      "priority": "high",
      "dueDate": "2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z",
      "project": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012b",
      "createdBy": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:10:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
```

List tasks in a project with filtering by status/priority/assignedTo, sorting, and pagination.

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "tasks": [
      {
        "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012d",
        "title": "Implement JWT Rotation",
        "status": "todo",
        "priority": "high"
      }
    ],
    "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10,
      "total": 1,
      "totalPages": 1
    }
  }
}
```

Update task status, priority, description, or assignedTo (Creator or Assignee).

Example Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "task": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012d",
      "title": "Implement JWT Rotation",
      "status": "in-progress",
      "priority": "high"
    }
  }
}
```

Post a comment on a task (Project members only).

Example Response (201 Created):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "comment": {
      "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012e",
      "text": "Initial PR opened for review!",
      "task": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012d",
      "author": {
        "_id": "660b4a1b2c3d4e5f6789012a",
        "name": "Jane Doe",
        "email": "jane@example.com"
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:15:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
```
